                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Hot Squat has a way of motivating me to keep going, and I can't say why. Would never do more than 100 squats on my own without vr, but in game, I'll go all out. A part of it has to do with competitiveness and seeing the leader board.\nI like the retro gym setting, and the bold colors. The transparent walls help to give the gym setting more space, and so you can get ready for the next squat. \nMusic is non-offensive and gets meditative after your first couple hundred squats. \nA couple things i'd love to see in any possible future updates are the option to choose different music, or even stream personal favorite artists/albums, and maybe squat variations (side lunges and curtsies)\n\n",
